' An unhandled error in a form event of a built exe shows the error's box, and the program then
' goes on running. Build the exe and run it: FormE is the startup object, its Form_Load raises
' an error, and once that box is closed Form_Activate shows a second box.
Module Startup

    ' For scripts/bug_repro.mjs only: tbrun runs the exe after the IDE has run a [RunAfterBuild] Sub.
    [RunAfterBuild]
    Private Sub Built()
        Debug.Cls
        Debug.Print "built"
    End Sub

End Module
